#
# Pre-create the openbao log file with the intended mode. openbao logs
# via the systemd override StandardOutput=append:, and systemd would
# otherwise create it under the service UMask (too restrictive). This
# ensures /var/log/openbao.log is root:root 0640 before the service
# starts. logrotate (copytruncate) then preserves this mode.
#
f /var/log/openbao.log 0640 root root -
